Shipped today on apps.ce-net.com/oauth/device and /oauth/authorize:

- both screens now render on the design cell with the brand lockup and the card look of the sign-in page: mono eyebrow with a live dot, uppercase display title, mono signal rows, oversized device code;
- each consent shows the agent, its scope, the exact return address, and YOU ARE (the account's gate person) - a wrong account is visible before Allow;
- the device page shows the expiry and a Deny that says what to do if you did not start it;
- the entry page is a big auto-uppercase code input; the done page names what happene
